msgstr "Nu s-au putut încărca adnotările acestei lame: {}"

#. Translators: a second read is an independent annotation of the slide by another person
#. (as in a reader study), not a clinical second opinion. Data, Second reader and Blinded
#. copy are the tab, section and button of the annotations panel: use their translations.
#: src/core.rs:670
msgid ""
"{opened} has the same content as {annotated}, so it shows and edits the same "
"annotations. For an independent second read, use Data → Second reader → "
"Blinded copy."
msgstr ""
"{opened} are același conținut ca {annotated}, deci afișează și editează "
"aceleași adnotări. Pentru o a doua evaluare independentă, folosiți Date → Al "
"doilea evaluator → Copie oarbă."

