"CPS {score} — ({a} {positive} + {c} {immune}) la {n} celule tumorale "
"({positive} + {negative}) × 100."
msgstr[2] ""
"CPS {score} — ({a} {positive} + {c} {immune}) la {n} de celule tumorale "
